# DAMA-CRM Project Rules

## Permanent Logo Assets Rule
- The official and immutable logos of DAMA-CRM are in `client/public/assets/logos/`:
  - `dama-symbol-dark.png`
  - `dama-symbol-white.png`
  - `dama-symbol-color.png`
  - `dama-logo-dark.png`
  - `dama-logo-white.png`
  - `dama-logo-color.png`
  - `dama-logo-black.png`
  - `dama-logo-vertical-dark.png`
  - `dama-logo-vertical-white.png`
  - `sample-company-logo.svg`
- NEVER delete, modify, or replace these logos. Always use these PNG files for branding.

## Light Mode Theme Scale
- Light mode MUST always use a comfortable grayscale / slate scale (`bg-slate-100/90` / `#F1F5F9`) instead of blinding pure white backgrounds.

## Centered Popups and Modals
- All popups, dialogs, and modals (Language modal, Tenant switcher, Onboarding wizard, Time tracking / Clock-in, User Profile) MUST be centered in the screen (`fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center p-4 m-auto`), NEVER positioned at the top of the screen.
